# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  .gitignore — keep the repo clean of local-only / generated junk
#  Tracked on purpose: the deliverable *.svg, README.md and the
#  GitHub workflow. The entire _build/ toolkit is local-only and
#  NOT tracked (the SVGs are self-contained, so it isn't needed).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ===== OS junk =====
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ===== Editor / IDE =====
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ===== Node =====
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/
.pnp/
.pnp.js

# ===== Environment / secrets =====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# ===== Logs & temp =====
*.log
*.tmp
tmp/
temp/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  _build/ — local-only build toolkit (generators, image data,
#  screenshots, Chrome profile). The deliverable SVGs are fully
#  self-contained, so none of this is needed in the repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_build/
